  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "My bedroom is dirty after a busy week at school. I open the window and let the morning light in. A white pillow lies on the bed beside a blue blanket. I put my toy in the drawer near the closet. Then I move the chair away from the window. My brother helps me clean the floor with water. We also make the bed and pick up our clothes. The room is tidy, and there is space to play. We sit down and enjoy the bright room together.",
    "textZh": "在學校忙了一週後，我的臥室很髒。我打開窗戶，讓晨光照進來。床上有一個白色枕頭，旁邊是藍色毛毯。我把玩具放進衣櫥附近的抽屜。接著我把椅子從窗邊移開。哥哥幫我用水清理地板。我們也整理床鋪，撿起衣服。房間整潔了，也有空間可以玩。我們一起坐下，享受明亮的房間。",
